Hey 👋 
Couple of mentions below:

{quote}* *_Pending_*_: Advise the rider to try later, starting the verification from scratch._{quote}

From Verification point of view, it means that the verification is ongoing. The final state should be reached in a couple of seconds, up to couple of minutes



----

{quote}*_FACES_DONT_MATCH_*, *_ATTEMPTED_DECEIT_DEVICE_SCREEN_USED_*, *_ATTEMPTED_DECEIT_PRINTOUT_USED_*{quote}

Generally, the status of the verification is {{verified_not_ok}} when one of the reasons above is present. That means that user is blocked and normally, cannot retry. The reason is self-explanatory, we consider this a fraud attempt.


----

{quote}* The rider can retry as many times as needed.{quote}

This no longer applies. At this point, any user has 3 retriable attempts (for example {{FACE NOT_FOUND}}) before we set the verification to {{verified_not_ok}} and mark it with {{FLOW_RUN_RETRY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED}}

----

{quote}*_TASK_TIMEOUT_*{quote}

This is an error on our side. It’s generally accompanied by {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}. Please contact Verification Team in case user has this error.

